flowchart LR
    M[Model or sensor output] --> C[Context and validity checks]
    C --> SM[Persistence / confidence smoothing]
    SM --> E[Source-labelled event state]
    E --> R[Bounded risk contribution]
    R --> UI[Dashboard alert and explanation]
    R --> LOG[Structured event log]

    M -->|audio speech| G[In-memory utterance gate]
    G -->|explicit opt-in only| TS[Transcript store]
    G -->|default| DROP[Raw audio discarded]
    TS --> EXP[Readable transcript export]

    E -->|telemetry replay| NOTE[Prediction only;<br/>source labels hidden]

    classDef process fill:#EAF3FF,stroke:#2F80ED,color:#172B4D;
    classDef privacy fill:#EDF9F0,stroke:#27AE60,color:#173B2C;
    classDef output fill:#FFF4D9,stroke:#F2994A,color:#5E3A00;
    class M,C,SM,E,R process;
    class G,TS,DROP,EXP,NOTE privacy;
    class UI,LOG output;
